    {
      "id": "instructions",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Create the authored edge",
      "position": {
        "x": 440,
        "y": 0
      },
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Authored typed workspace edge\n\nOpen fixture 11 alongside. Drag the **Smoke Signal Export** handle on this graph's border into fixture 11.\n\nFixture 11 exposes an input that accepts `smoke-signal`. The drop authors one workspace-owned edge; it does not add an authored import Bridge to either child document.\n\nZoom out. Expect one thick magenta dashed workspace edge plus derived **EX** and **IM** endpoint Bridges."
        }
      }
    },
